From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 19:45:03 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] explorer: FindWindowSW skips windows without a location
 (3251)

A window put in the shell window list with Register has no location until
OnNavigate reports one. FindWindowSW compared the location asked for with
that missing pidl, which crashed the shell process when a browser window
had registered and not navigated yet. Such a window matches no location.

diff --git a/programs/explorer/desktop.c b/programs/explorer/desktop.c
index 6250d69..4806526 100644
--- a/programs/explorer/desktop.c
+++ b/programs/explorer/desktop.c
@@ -4212,7 +4212,9 @@ static HRESULT WINAPI shellwindows_FindWindowSW(IShellWindows *iface, VARIANT *l
             continue;
         }
 #endif
-        if (sw->windows[i].class == class && ILIsEqual(V_ARRAY(location)->pvData, sw->windows[i].pidl))
+        /* a window that has not reported where it is yet matches no location */
+        if (sw->windows[i].pidl && sw->windows[i].class == class
+            && ILIsEqual(V_ARRAY(location)->pvData, sw->windows[i].pidl))
         {
             *hwnd = sw->windows[i].hwnd;
             LeaveCriticalSection(&sw->cs);
